Chapter: BvtDayLight
  cites Uoaix chapter DayLight
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 UOAIX-244: the light follows the game clock (OUO's hourly table less both moons) and a dungeon stays at 27. Midnight:
 30 less Trammel phase 4 and Felucca phase 4, 4 each, is 22, times 12 / 30 is 8; hour 19: 20 less phases 2 and 6, 2
 each, is 16, times 12 / 30 is 6.
  bdyl-range : Integer -> Boolean
  bdyl-range (minute) = if minute >= 1440 then True else let l = dl-light 1000 (minute * 60) in l >= 0 & l <= 30 & bdyl-range (minute + 1)
  bvt-day-light : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-day-light (unused) = act
    a <- bvt-check "noon is full daylight, midnight 8, hour 19 6 (night capped at dl-night 12), a dungeon 27 at noon and at midnight (UOAIX-244)" (dl-light 1400 (12 * 3600) == 0 & dl-light 1400 0 == 8 & dl-light 1400 (19 * 3600) == 6 & dl-light 5200 (12 * 3600) == 27 & dl-light 5200 0 == 27 & dl-light 1400 (86400 + 12 * 3600) == 0)
    b <- bvt-check "outside a dungeon the night is not the dungeon's light, a dungeon at noon is not daylight, and every minute of the day lies in 0..30" (dl-light 5119 0 /= 27 & dl-light 5200 (12 * 3600) /= 0 & bdyl-range 0)
    a + b
  end
